  "notes": [
    "The CREATE2 deployment installed the direct USM runtime containing the FUM pricing logic, and the same runtime remained active through the exploit.",
    "Campaign: every later tx in which USM both received ETH from fund() and paid more out via defund(), by the attacker and copycat bots (36 txs within ~3,300 blocks); none before the anchor. Loss is USM's summed per-tx net ETH outflow, 132.58 of the 132.59 ETH it held, priced per tx."
